#: includes/pro/fact-check.php:100
msgid ""
"For articles that check a claim. Readers see the claim and your verdict in a"
" box after the first paragraph, and the article gets fact-check "
"(ClaimReview) structured data. Google no longer shows fact-check snippets in"
" Search, but fact-check databases, other platforms and AI tools still read "
"this markup."
msgstr ""
